ime_poses.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/2/26/Doremitchi_sopratchi_anime_poses.png/revision/latest?cb=20150710031900","caption":"Doremitchi sopratchi anime poses.png"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Melomamatchi.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/2/26/Melomamatchi.png/revision/latest?cb=20170501150802","caption":"Melomamatchi.png"}],"related":[{"id":"tamagotchi-on-24dbc2","title":"Tamagotchi On","ru":"Tamagotchi On","kind":"device","note":"гость (NPC)"},{"id":"tamagotchi-id-l-06561f","title":"Tamagotchi iD L","ru":"Tamagotchi iD L","kind":"device","note":"гость (NPC)"},{"id":"tamagotchi-m-x-e0c3cb","title":"Tamagotchi m!x","ru":"Tamagotchi m!x","kind":"device","note":"гость (NPC)"}]}